.--------McDonald's Pakistan Landing Page Clone--------

A responsive, pixel-perfect clone of the McDonald's Pakistan landing page. Built using vanilla HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, featuring a dynamic hero carousel slider, responsive layout grids, custom brand styling, and media query breakpoints.

https://mcdonalds.com.pk/

-------Features--------

1. Responsive Navigation Header: Utility bar, brand logo, right action buttons, and horizontal navigation links.
2. Dynamic Hero Carousel: Fully functional image slider with automatic slide rotation and synchronized navigation dots.
3. Responsive Main Grid: Flexible card display showcasing McDonald's categories (McCafé, McDelivery, Mobile App, Menu, etc.).
4. Footer & Company Information: Structured footer columns, custom SVG social icons(from bootstrap) with brand hover transitions, and mobile app download badges.
5. Fully Mobile-Friendly: Designed using CSS Grid, Flexbox, CSS Variables, and Media Queries for seamless rendering on mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.

--------Built With--------

1. HTML5: Semantic document structure.
2. CSS3: Custom properties (CSS variables), Flexbox, CSS Grid, animations, and Media Queries.
3. JavaScript (Vanilla): DOM manipulation, carousel logic, and autoplay timer.


--------Project Structure--------

mcdonalds-clone/
│
├── Mcdonalds.html    # Main HTML structure
├── Mcdonalds.css     # Styling and media queries
├── images/           # Assets (logos, banners, card images)
└── README.md         # Documentation

--------Responsive Breakpoints--------

> 1024px — Desktop / Laptop layout.
768px - 1024px — Tablet view with compact multi-column layouts.
< 768px — Mobile layout with stacked flex containers and horizontal navbar scroll.